Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Setup", "Section", ExpressionUUID -> 
       "49d0505e-47ca-4580-9b8d-2ab25d02d453"],

Cell["\<\
This entry realises the accelerating, rotating, dyonic AdS4 black hole of \
arXiv:2106.05571 (section 2.1), a solution of minimal D=4, N=2 gauged \
supergravity -- theory entry Thr__4dL__Minimal-gauged. The theory Lagrangian \
(R + 6/l4^2)vol - 2 F wedge star-F matches the paper's action (2.1) with l = \
l4 and F^2 = F_{mu nu}F^{mu nu}; the paper sets l = 1, here l4 is kept \
general throughout -- every check below is the l-restored statement.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9969146897975063`*^9, 
  3.996914690629402*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"0f4fd980-b0d5-44b3-9c75-\
ef467f0ed056"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"sol", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
   "GetData", "[", "\"\<Curated/Thr__4dL__Minimal-gauged\>\"", "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Load", "@", "sol"}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.996914668010638*^9, 3.9969146699942093`*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[4]:=",ExpressionUUID->"02dca838-5b36-4d1b-9b9a-acfcbcb47c10"],

