Cell["\<\
The metric, paper eq. (2.2), and gauge field, eq. (2.4), rewritten with cos \
theta = -x: sin^2theta -> 1 - x^2, dtheta^2 -> dx^2/(1 - x^2), g cos theta -> \
-g x. F = dA is computed, not typed.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8bcfbbc1-8142-47e7-a61a-7f06e72bff6e"],

