}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Substituting the explicit P, Q (rule func) kills every component -- this \
verifies that (2.2)-(2.4) solve the theory, with general l4.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"005b69c0-e7de-4c8f-87e7-136ad7b629df"],

