Cell["\<\
Companion NONZERO checks (a zero can be vacuous): the trace of the Einstein \
equation forces R = -12/l4^2 on shell, and the field strength must not vanish.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f1e909e1-44da-4289-8d9a-5c0363452b66"],

