Cell["\<\
Maxwell dstarF = 0 holds for ARBITRARY P(x), Q(r): for the PD-type ansatz \
only the Einstein equations constrain the structure functions. Two of the \
four components vanish identically already at the array level; the remaining \
two vanish under Simplify with P, Q symbolic.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a073d7d9-4c0f-4ee3-93ee-3d5829bb582c"],

