Cell["\<\
Section 2.2 of the paper. The poles theta- = 0 and theta+ = pi are x = -1 and \
x = +1. With Xi == 1 + alpha^2(a^2 + e^2 + g^2) - a^2/l4^2, eq. (2.9)-(2.10), \
the pole values of P are P+- == P(theta+-) = P(x = +-1) = Xi +- 2alpham; both \
differences below must vanish.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ef3f2a78-bfdb-42a7-bbed-65321166b49c"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
