Cell["\<\
Cosmic string tensions, eq. (2.11): mu+- = (1 - P+- Dphi/2pi)/(4G4). The \
identity chain (2.12): mu- - mu+ = (alpham/G4)(Dphi/2pi) and mu- + mu+ = (1 - \
Xi Dphi/2pi)/(2G4) -- these hold for ANY Dphi. Then (2.13)-(2.14) under the \
spindle rule: 1/n+- = 1 - 4G4 mu+-, and the orbifold Euler characteristic chi \
= 1/n- + 1/n+ = 2 - 4G4(mu- + mu+).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"03cb34c3-c7e4-46dd-a866-6194629a11dc"],

