Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Thermodynamic potentials", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"bb9da95b-645f-4e51-a2e9-ca49d790b256"],

Cell["\<\
Section 3.2 of arXiv:2106.05571. These sections continue \
Sol__4dL__Accelerating-black-hole__PD, whose earlier sections carry the \
solution, the verified equations of motion and the regularity package of \
section 2.2. Everything below is in the polynomialised chart (cos theta = -x) \
and keeps l4 general; the paper sets l = 1.

The constant kappa in the metric normalises the time coordinate and was \
deliberately left free in section 2. It is fixed at the very end of this \
notebook, by eq. (3.42), because that is the choice -- and the only choice -- \
for which the first law holds.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2381bdf7-4ca7-410c-889d-704c4ffd15de"],

