Cell["\<\
The angular velocity of the horizon, paper eq. (3.28). The null generator of \
the horizon is d/dt + omega_H d/dphi with omega_H = -g_tphi/g_phiphi \
evaluated on the horizon; that this is a CONSTANT on the horizon -- \
independent of x -- is the statement that the horizon is a Killing horizon, \
and is checked rather than assumed. The paper's Omega_H carries the extra 2 \
pi/Delta phi from its normalisation of the azimuthal coordinate.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3f343f2f-badd-42ae-8cd6-9a1b5ba5b698"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"wH", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"-", 
