}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
The first law, paper eq. (3.43), requires the time normalisation kappa of eq. \
(3.42) and the extra thermodynamic variables of eq. (3.40): the potentials \
lambda_pm conjugate to the cosmic string tensions mu_pm (the tensions \
themselves were derived in section 2.2 of this entry), the pressure p \
conjugate to the cosmological constant, its volume v, and the combination xi \
conjugate to Newton's constant.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"878362fb-77d9-4f5e-b8dd-d4d5031e6084"],

